So why should you act more like a web developer, right?

00:52.120 --> 00:54.920
One, you can end some drudgery, make your life easier.

00:54.920 --> 00:59.000
Two, you can prevent mistakes and screw ups and, you know, have a happier life.

00:59.000 --> 01:04.000
Three, you can improve teamwork, which I know is hard for reporters to hear, but it's true.

01:04.000 --> 01:05.440
And three, you can command robots.

01:05.440 --> 01:10.840
You can ultimately get good enough at it that you sort of, you make extensions of yourself

01:10.840 --> 01:12.360
that go out there, all right?

01:12.360 --> 01:16.800
So, the talk is called Django Unchained because Django is a Python framework for helping you

01:16.800 --> 01:17.800
build websites.

01:17.800 --> 01:18.800
It's really nice.

